---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'Official Rules · Week Without Driving Las Vegas';
const description = 'Rules for the Week Without Driving Las Vegas giveaway, October 1 to 8, 2026.';
---

<BaseLayout {title} {description}>
  <section class="container-page page-top reading">
    <h1 class="page-title">Official Rules</h1>
    <p class="page-lede">Week Without Driving Las Vegas Giveaway · October 1–8, 2026</p>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-on-surface-variant">Last updated September 29, 2026</p>

    <article class="prose-doc mt-10">
      <p>
        These Official Rules govern participation in the Week Without Driving Las Vegas Giveaway. By
        entering, you agree to follow them.
      </p>

      <h2>Who runs it</h2>
      <p>
        Las Vegans for Better Transit (LVBT), a tax-exempt organization under Section 501(c)(3) of
        the Internal Revenue Code, sponsors and administers this giveaway. No purchase, donation, or
        social media post is required to enter or win.
      </p>

      <h2>Who can enter</h2>
      <p>
        A person can enter if they live in Clark, Esmeralda, Lincoln, or Nye County, Nevada, and are
        13 or older. People ages 13 through 17 need a parent or guardian’s approval before they sign
        up. People who review entries or draw the winner cannot win the prize.
      </p>

      <h2>When to enter</h2>
      <p>
        Entries are open each day from October 1 through October 8, 2026. Each day begins at 12:00
        a.m. and ends at 11:59 p.m. Las Vegas time. A person must submit a trip on the day they took
        it.
      </p>

      <h2>How to enter</h2>
      <p>
        Each person signs up once at <a href="/sign-up">lvwwd.org/sign-up</a> with a first name, email
        address, ZIP code, county, and age group. An Instagram handle is optional.
      </p>
      <p>
        On a day a person takes a trip without driving, they can open <a href="/my-week">My week</a
        >, choose how they got around, and describe the trip. Bus, walking or rolling, biking or
        scooting, and getting a ride all count. My week needs an internet connection to submit an
        entry. A post link or screenshot can be added, but neither is required. The separate “Was
        anything hard?” question is optional and does not replace the trip description.
      </p>
      <p>
        An Instagram post or Story can count only if it comes from the handle saved with the
        person’s sign-up, shows a trip without driving, and tags @lasvegasfortransit. LVBT checks
        those tags by hand. Posts from another handle do not count. A post used to enter must say
        “Week Without Driving giveaway entry” at the start of the caption or in the Story. A person
        can also submit the trip in My week.
      </p>
      <p>
        There is no mail entry. A person can receive one entry each day and no more than eight
        entries total. A My week entry and an Instagram tag for the same day receive one entry. LVBT
        checks each entry before the drawing. Duplicate entries and entries that do not describe a
        trip without driving do not count.
      </p>

      <h2>Prize and drawing</h2>
      <p>
        One winner receives one 30-day RTC bus pass. There is no cash alternative. LVBT will draw
        the winner at random from eligible, reviewed entries by October 15, 2026. Each eligible
        entry has one chance, so the odds depend on the total number of eligible entries.
      </p>

      <h2>If you win</h2>
      <p>
        LVBT will contact the winner at the email address used to sign up. The winner has seven days
        to respond to LVBT’s email. If the winner does not respond or cannot accept the prize, LVBT
        will draw another winner. If the winner is under 18, a parent or guardian must accept the
        prize. LVBT will arrange delivery with the winner and will never ask for money, passwords,
        or bank details to release the prize.
      </p>

      <h2>Your information</h2>
      <p>
        LVBT uses sign-up details and trip entries to run and review the giveaway, contact the
        winner, and fulfill the prize. The <a href="/privacy">Privacy page</a> describes data use and
        deletion.
      </p>

      <h2>Instagram and questions</h2>
      <p>
        Instagram does not sponsor, administer, or endorse this giveaway. Questions? Email <a
          href="mailto:wwd@lasvegasfortransit.org">wwd@lasvegasfortransit.org</a
        >.
      </p>
    </article>

    <p class="mt-10">
      <a href="/giveaway" class="body-link font-semibold">&#8592; Back to the giveaway</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
